{
  "slug": "explore",
  "title": "Explore",
  "description": "A composed page: treeview navigation on the left, live API content and store-driven widgets in the middle.",
  "body": "This page is not coded — it is *composed*. Everything below is widgets placed on a `sidebar-left` layout in `content/pages/explore.json`.",
  "layout": {
    "template": "sidebar-left",
    "widgets": [
      {
        "type": "treeview",
        "region": "sidebar",
        "config": {
          "title": "Browse",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "Products",
              "children": [
                { "label": "Cortex", "href": "/products/cortex" },
                { "label": "Reflex", "href": "/products/reflex" },
                { "label": "Relay", "href": "/products/relay" },
                { "label": "Synapse", "href": "/products/synapse" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "pagesPrefix": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "api",
        "region": "main",
        "config": {
          "title": "Live from the MusicBrainz API (no relation!)",
          "url": "https://musicbrainz.org/ws/2/instrument?query=synthesizer&fmt=json&limit=5",
          "headers": {
            "User-Agent": "ImprintEngine/0.1 (https://github.com/MarkWestbroek/imprint-engine)"
          },
          "itemsPath": "instruments",
          "fields": [
            { "label": "Instrument", "path": "name" },
            { "label": "Type", "path": "type" },
            { "label": "Description", "path": "description" }
          ],
          "limit": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "releases",
        "region": "main",
        "config": { "title": "Latest releases", "limit": 3 }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "region": "main",
        "config": {
          "title": "How this works",
          "markdown": "Each block on this page is a **widget**: a type name plus a config, validated against the schema the site registered for that type. Want a new kind of block? Add one schema to `src/widgets/registry.ts` and one component to `src/widgets/components.tsx` — then place it on any page."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
